      {
        "id": 10983,
        "name": "tzgardner",
        "username": "tzgardner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b77776/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-15T17:33:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been playing this game for a while now and still find myself having trouble keeping track of certain trigger cards in the game.&nbsp; For example, a trigger text might be \"every time a hero plays a cards . . . \" then do something.&nbsp; Sometimes I find myself forgetting about this in key game changing moments.&nbsp; Then several turns go by before I realize my mistake and then I feel like the game has been played out very differently than it should have.&nbsp; It get especially difficult when there are multiple triggers out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was wondering if anyone has any ideas or solutions on how to handle these triggers?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:11.220Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 3,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 15.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10980,
        "topic_slug": "solution-for-trigger-cards",
        "display_username": "tzgardner",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
