        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve been playing this game for a while now and still find myself having trouble keeping track of certain trigger cards in the game.&nbsp; For example, a trigger text might be &quot;every time a hero plays a cards . . . &quot; then do something.&nbsp; Sometimes I find myself forgetting about this in key game changing moments.&nbsp; Then several turns go by before I realize my mistake and then I feel like the game has been played out very differently than it should have.&nbsp; It get especially difficult when there are multiple triggers out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was wondering if anyone has any ideas or solutions on how to handle these triggers?</p>",
