        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I use the 3D tokens on my site.&nbsp; The little pyramids stand up off the cards so they&#39;re easy to see.&nbsp; If it&#39;s something like &quot;every time a hero plays a card...&quot;, I just toss a yellow &quot;!&quot; icon on it to remind me that there&#39;s something I need to keep an eye on on the card.&nbsp; Works well for me.</p>",
